<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Clipdrop is Stability AI's ecosystem of AI-powered image editing tools designed for speed, simplicity, and professional results. Originally known for its revolutionary AR copy-paste technology, Clipdrop has evolved into a comprehensive suite of specialized AI tools that handle everything from background removal to image upscaling and creative generation.</p>
<p>What makes Clipdrop unique is its tool-focused approach. Rather than offering one all-encompassing app, Clipdrop provides individual specialized tools that each excel at specific tasks. This modular design makes it incredibly fast and efficient - you use exactly the tool you need when you need it, without navigating complex interfaces or menus.</p>
