<h2 id="image-quality">Image Quality &amp; Style Control</h2>
<h3>Image Quality</h3>
<p>Clipdrop delivers professional-grade results across its editing tools. Background removal rivals paid services like Remove.bg, while cleanup and uncrop produce impressively seamless results. The SDXL image generation creates high-quality outputs suitable for commercial use, though it may not match the artistic capabilities of Midjourney or the versatility of DALL-E 3.</p>
<h3>Style Control</h3>
<p>Style control varies by tool:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Text to Image:</strong> Supports detailed prompts with style modifiers and negative prompts</li>
<li><strong>Editing Tools:</strong> Most tools are automatic with minimal manual controls for simplicity</li>
<li><strong>Relight:</strong> Intuitive visual controls for lighting direction and intensity</li>
<li><strong>Uncrop:</strong> Smart context-aware expansion that matches original image style</li>
<li><strong>Prompt Guidance:</strong> Built-in examples and suggestions for better generation</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="commercial-rights">Commercial Usage Rights</h2>
<p>Clipdrop's licensing is clear and business-friendly:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Pro License:</strong> Full commercial rights for all outputs created with Pro subscription</li>
<li><strong>SDXL Licensing:</strong> Commercial use allowed under Stability AI's license terms</li>
<li><strong>No Attribution:</strong> No requirement to credit Clipdrop in your work</li>
<li><strong>API Commercial Terms:</strong> Separate commercial licensing for API usage</li>
<li><strong>Free Tier Limits:</strong> Personal use only on free tier; Pro required for commercial work</li>
<li><strong>Enterprise Options:</strong> Custom licensing available for high-volume commercial needs</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="prompt-engineering">Prompt Engineering</h2>
<h3>Text to Image Prompts</h3>
<p>For Clipdrop's Stable Diffusion XL generation:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Be Descriptive:</strong> "Professional product photo of red sneaker on white background, studio lighting"</li>
<li><strong>Specify Details:</strong> Include camera angles, lighting, mood, and composition details</li>
<li><strong>Use Negative Prompts:</strong> Exclude unwanted elements for cleaner results</li>
<li><strong>Style Keywords:</strong> Add "photorealistic," "oil painting," "digital art" for style control</li>
<li><strong>Quality Terms:</strong> Include "high quality," "detailed," "sharp focus" for better outputs</li>
</ul>
<h3>Tool-Specific Tips</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Cleanup:</strong> Mark unwanted objects precisely; the AI handles the rest automatically</li>
<li><strong>Uncrop:</strong> Works best when expanding in directions that have contextual clues</li>
<li><strong>Relight:</strong> Use preview mode to find the perfect lighting angle before processing</li>
<li><strong>Background Removal:</strong> Works automatically; high-contrast subjects yield best results</li>
</ul>
